OL,3,GNEWSADeveloper unveils plan to demolish
OL,4,ASandbanks hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FDevelopers say they intend to demolish
OL,7,Fa landmark seaside hotel on the
OL,8,Fexclusive Sandbanks peninsula in 2027,
OL,9,Fbut have not said what will replace it.
OL,11,FThe Haven Hotel, built in 1887 and
OL,12,Fexpanded in the 1920s, occupies the
OL,13,Fsouthern corner of Sandbanks, at the
OL,14,Fentrance to Poole Harbour in Dorset.
OL,16,FPlanning Strategy Ltd has asked
OL,17,FBournemouth Christchurch and Poole
OL,18,FCouncil (BCP) whether prior permission
OL,19,Fis required for the method of
OL,20,Fdemolition, which it intends to begin 1
OL,21,FOctober 2027.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
